# Restoration (M+) DPS profile for the Cat/Bear weaving harness.
#
# SimC has no usable healing model, so this profile exists ONLY to measure the
# DAMAGE half of FerrazRestoDruid.yaml — the catweave/bearweave/ranged_dps
# lists. Nothing about the healing priority can be validated here.
#
# Gear: SimC's own MID1 Balance preset. There is no MID1 Restoration preset;
# Balance is the closest match since both wear Intellect gear. The absolute
# numbers are therefore NOT this character's DPS — only the deltas between
# variants mean anything.

